; What the Lojix Nexus attempts: eleven writes and three reads of its
; Memory, and the ten stages of a deploy or test pipeline, each one
; operation, and the outcome each comes to. A peer's input is answered
; through its contract's dispatch, which applies the Memory operation it
; needs; a deploy or test pipeline attempts its stages and applies the
; writes its stages record.
;
; The Memory operations follow the running code: the writes first, in the
; order they were declared, then the reads. The stages follow after them,
; each named as the doing: an attempt composes the emissions it needs, from
; ethos/emission.ethos, and ends in its outcome or in EffectFailed, the
; outcome every stage shares. The outcomes name what each operation came
; to; the configuration rejections, a write the store rejected, a read
; that missed, and a store that failed under either stand after the Memory
; outcomes. The behaviour that carries out each operation is hand-written
; beside it, in schema_runtime.rs: the Memory operations synchronously, the
; stages awaiting their emissions.
Operation

[ signal_lojix:[ LojixNexusConfiguration DeploymentPhaseEvent TestRunRecord Selection
                 EventLogRange TestRunLookup ConfigurationReceipt ConfigurationRejection
                 GenerationListing EventLogPage TestRunListing StoreFailure DatabaseMarker
                 GenerationIdentifier ClusterName NodeName DeploymentEnvironment GenerationSlot
                 ClosurePath EventLogPosition FlakeReference SourceRevisionPolicy UserName
                 SecretsInput GenerationArtifact DeploymentOutputSelector NixBuilderSpec
                 DeploymentTransport DeploymentIdentifier ActivationEffect ActivationBackend
                 HostDeployAction UserEnvironmentAction TestExecutionProfile FailureEvidence ]
  meta_signal_lojix:[ ActualizedDeploySubmission PinRequest UnpinRequest RetireRequest
                      DeployHandle AppliedPin AppliedUnpin AppliedRetire AcceptedTest
                      ExtraSubstituter ]
  horizon_lib:[ HorizonDefinition ]
  :crate:memory:[ PhaseReceipt SourceRevisionRecord ContainerName ContainerState
                  PersistedFlakeInputOverride ]
  :crate:emission:[ OperatorNode GuestNode GuestAddress CollectedPaths ] ]

[ OrdinaryConfigure.LojixNexusConfiguration
  MetaConfigure.LojixNexusConfiguration
  ReverseConfiguration
